 "title": "如何找论文？ - 飞书云文档",
 "blocks": {
  "2": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">如何找论文                                                                                                                                       </span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "heading1"
  },
  "3": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">从重要会议和期刊中寻找论文</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "heading2"
  },
  "4": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">AI方向主要是以会议论文为主，每次会议放榜之后都可以看到所有文章的列表，如果是openreview的会议，还可以看到所有投稿的文章，可以基于关键词、论文题目找到和自己研究方向相关的文章，所以</span><span data-string=\"true\" style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572 textHighlight textHighlight-pink-text textHighlight-ccmtoken-doc-textcolor-red\" data-leaf=\"true\">每次会议投稿截止和会议放榜之后，都应该对相关的文章进行一次筛选和阅读。</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "text"
  },
  "5": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">不同方向关注的会议和期刊有所区别，常见的包括：</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "text"
  },
  "6": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">机器学习：ICML、NeurIPS、ICLR</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "bullet"
  },
  "7": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">自然语言处理：ACL、EMNLP、COLM</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "bullet"
  },
  "8": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">计算机视觉：CVPR、ICCV、ECCV</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "bullet"
  },
  "9": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">人工智能：AAAI、IJCAI</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "bullet"
  },
  "10": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">数据挖掘与信息检索：KDD</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "bullet"
  },
  "11": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">综合性高影响力期刊：TPAMI、JMLR、TMLR、TKDE、Nature Machine Intelligence 等</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "bullet"
  },
  "12": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">以上名单不是固定的，也不是评价论文价值的唯一标准。进入具体方向后，应根据导师建议和该领域的引用习惯，建立自己的重点 venue 列表。</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "text"
  },
  "13": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">从“种子论文”开始扩展</span><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">：</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "heading2"
  },
  "14": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">刚进入一个方向时，有效的方法是先找到几篇“种子论文”，再以它们为中心扩展。</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "text"
  },
  "15": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">适合作为种子论文的通常包括：</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "text"
  },
  "16": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">近几年发表的高质量 Survey；</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "bullet"
  },
  "17": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">该方向公认的代表性工作；</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "bullet"
  },
  "18": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">与自己的研究问题最接近的论文；</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "bullet"
  },
  "19": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">被广泛使用的 Benchmark论文；</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "bullet"
  },
  "20": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">最近两年顶会中发表的代表性论文；</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "bullet"
  },
  "21": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">导师或同学推荐的论文。</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "bullet"
  },
  "22": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">沿着论文的文献网络“顺藤摸瓜”</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "heading2"
  },
  "23": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">读一篇文章不仅仅只是读这一篇文章，而是</span><span data-string=\"true\" style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572 textHighlight textHighlight-pink-text textHighlight-ccmtoken-doc-textcolor-red\" data-leaf=\"true\">以一篇文章为引子，顺藤摸瓜</span><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">，通过Introduction、Related Works、Compared Methods、References等去找更多相关的文章。</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "text"
  },
  "24": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">向后追踪</span><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">：查看论文引用了哪些早期工作</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "bullet"
  },
  "25": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">向前追踪</span><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">：查看后来有哪些工作引用、改进、质疑或扩展了这篇论文</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "bullet"
  },
  "26": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\"> 关注作者、课题组和研究团队</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "heading2"
  },
  "27": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">读论文的过程中也要关注作者的课题组信息，如果某个课题组和你做的方向一致，那么大概率他们会有一系列相关的文章和做这个方向的学生。</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "text"
  },
  "28": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">可以进一步查看：</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "text"
  },
  "29": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">通讯作者和主要作者的个人主页；</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "bullet"
  },
  "30": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">作者的 Google Scholar、DBLP 或 Semantic Scholar 页面；</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "bullet"
  },
  "31": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">实验室主页；</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "bullet"
  },
  "32": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">作者近期发表的论文和正在指导的学生；</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "bullet"
  },
  "33": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">论文对应的 GitHub 组织、Project Page 和 Hugging Face 主页；</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "bullet"
  },
  "34": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">作者在学术报告、社交平台中发布的研究介绍</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "bullet"
  },
  "35": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">从代码、数据集和 Benchmark 生态寻找论文</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "heading2"
  },
  "36": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">AI研究往往围绕模型、代码库、数据集和 Benchmark 形成研究生态。因此，找论文时不要只搜索论文标题，还可以反向搜索：</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "text"
  },
  "37": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">数据集或 Benchmark的官方网站；</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "bullet"
  },
  "38": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">Leaderboard 上的方法及对应论文；</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "bullet"
  },
  "39": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">Hugging Face 的 Models、Datasets 和 Papers 页面；</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "bullet"
  },
  "40": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">代码仓库的 Issues、Pull Requests 和后续实现；</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "bullet"
  },
  "41": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">新论文实验表格中使用的Compared Methods</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "bullet"
  },
  "42": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">例如，当某个 Benchmark 与自己的方向高度相关时，可以从其 Leaderboard 上找到近年来参与比较的主要方法，再进一步查找对应论文。</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "text"
  },
  "43": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">关注各大平台以及各种论文推荐网站</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
